DELETE /v1/metrics-stream/{ownerId}
Deletes the metrics stream for the specified workspace.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return metrics stream information for

GET /v1/metrics-stream/{ownerId}
Returns metrics stream information for the specified workspace.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return metrics stream information for

PUT /v1/metrics-stream/{ownerId}
Creates or updates the metrics stream for the specified workspace.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return metrics stream information for; body (body)
